WEBVTT

00:14:29.031 --> 00:14:32.659
unless they have access
to universal basic services.

00:14:32.701 --> 00:14:36.288
This is the way by which
we guarantee liberty for all

00:14:36.330 --> 00:14:39.666
and address the great challenges
of the 21st century --

00:14:39.708 --> 00:14:42.836
the climate crisis,
inequality, demographic aging --

00:14:42.836 --> 00:14:45.964
whilst leveraging
these remarkable technologies

00:14:46.006 --> 00:14:48.717
that the ingenuity
of our species has created.

00:14:49.635 --> 00:14:53.472
I don't think there's another way
of addressing those challenges.

00:14:53.472 --> 00:14:58.268
I think anybody who thinks otherwise
is delusional, frankly.

00:14:59.895 --> 00:15:02.439
But all that means
we're going to have to do something